  ('lib-15f2b7a62efc9ad6063a7042', 'The Problem People Didn''t Know Existed · Get verified free', 'Your Facebook page shows your work: the setups, the plated dinners, the happy couples. ⤵
It doesn''t show the one thing nervous couples now look for: your papers.

After the Cebu cases where dozens of couples lost what they had paid to a coordinator, more couples ask a new first question: "Registered po ba kayo?"

A real business already has the answer: a DTI or SEC registration, a BIR 2303, a Mayor''s permit. The trouble is that none of it shows on a page full of beautiful photos, so an honest supplier and a fake one look exactly the same at first glance.

On Setnayan, a shop gets Verified by sending three papers for a person to check. Verified is free, and only Verified shops appear when couples search. Your work shows, and so do your papers.

