  ('lib-0d6d20cd78ecbedf88be30cc', 'The Problem People Didn''t Know Existed · Make your quote the easy yes', 'You wrote your quote at your desk, carefully. ⤵
The couple reads it at 11 p.m., on a phone, between four others.

In bed, nobody reads the fine print. They scroll five near-identical prices and look for one reason to pick. Usually it isn''t the lowest number. It''s the offer that''s easiest to say yes to: the one that''s clear, that answers their question, and that has something the others don''t.

Most suppliers answer that by dropping the price. That works once, and teaches the couple your first price wasn''t real.

On Setnayan, every booking carries a gift for the couple, given in your name, from gift stock you buy ahead. Papic 150 fits any booking: 150 photos the couple''s guests take on their own phones, straight into the couple''s album. It shows on your quote, and it lands when their first payment clears. A small line that makes your quote the easy yes.

