  ('lib-bd7691c4c00f33e437a2e23c', 'Problems of a Coordinator · See every peso. Hold none of it.', '''Ate, ikaw na lang mag-abot sa caterer.'' Every coordinator has heard it. ⤵
Holding a client''s cash feels helpful, until a supplier says it never arrived.

On Setnayan, a coordinator sees the whole budget: every supplier, what''s agreed, what''s paid, what''s due next. But you can''t book or pay from it. The screen says it plainly: ''The hosts keep this.''

That isn''t a limit on you. It''s protection. The money goes from the hosts straight to each supplier, so nobody can ever say the coordinator lost a payment.

What you can do is see a payment coming due and tap ''Remind the hosts.'' You keep the event on track without ever touching the money, and every supplier can see that the payment came from the hosts themselves.

