  ('lib-e9d28b5f0019f71bd21f6d39', 'The Problem People Didn''t Know Existed · Get verified free', 'Before a nervous couple sends ''Hi po'', they open your page. ⤵
They scroll to the last post. If it''s from 2025, many of them close the tab.

After the stories of couples losing reservation fees to pages that vanished, your page has become a scam check. Couples look for signs of life: recent posts, recent events, replies to comments, a real address.

Here''s the unfair part. Many of the best suppliers post the least, because they''re busy doing events. A fully booked caterer and an abandoned page look exactly the same from the outside.

Posting more helps. But a couple''s real question isn''t ''are they active?'' It''s ''are they real?''

On Setnayan, that answer doesn''t depend on how often you post. To get Verified, a shop sends three papers (DTI or SEC, BIR 2303, a Mayor''s permit) for a person to check. Verified is free, it''s checked again every year, and only Verified shops show up when couples search.

