Coordination is mostly invisible work: meetings, supplier calls, timelines, the rehearsal, the twelve hours on the day. Couples can''t see it, so a price alone looks high, and ''PM for rates'' looks like you''re hiding something.

What helps is naming the work. How many meetings. How many people on your team on the day. How many hours. Whether you handle the rehearsal and the supplier calls.

On Setnayan, a service card can''t go online without a cover photo, a starting price and what''s included, so couples see the work and the price together. Only Verified shops appear when couples search, and getting verified is free.

