It also works the other way: the friend who said ''maybe'' and then ''go'' never made it onto the plan at all.

On Setnayan, the replies and the seat plan are one list. Each guest answers on their own link: going, not going or maybe, with a meal choice. A ''no'' frees their seat by itself, and the count follows. Pending guests keep their seats until you release them, so nobody is dropped on a guess.

