  ('lib-d839eb2e2a22648766fd7d9d', 'Problems of a Coordinator · Every client''s event, one screen', 'Five December events. Five group chats. One phone at 12%. ⤵
The client with the most messages gets your morning, not the one that needs it.

In peak season, the chats decide your day. Whoever sends the most messages pulls you in, and the quiet event with a real problem (a supplier who hasn''t confirmed, a payment that''s due) waits until it''s urgent.

On Setnayan, Events you run puts every client''s event side by side under one login, soonest first, each showing what needs you. When a host books you as their coordinator, their event opens for you automatically: guests, seat plan, schedule and suppliers, in one place.

