  ('lib-a4bbc7d0eada2b24154e0903', 'Problems of a Coordinator · Five checks before December', 'Five things to check on every event before December hits. ⤵
Save this before your first December Saturday.

1. Every event side by side: which Saturdays are crowded?
2. The right checklist: a debut, a christening and a corporate party each need their own list.
3. Every supplier chat: are you in all of them?
4. Money: what''s due this month, and have the hosts been reminded?
5. The day: who can change the schedule, and who has to ask?

On Setnayan, Events you run puts every client event side by side. Each event type gets its own checklist. You''re in every supplier chat and can''t be left out. You see what''s due and remind the hosts in one tap, and a supplier''s time change comes to you to decide.

One habit for this week: run the five checks every Monday morning in December, before you open a single new inquiry.

