  ('lib-06f6d039642746eed3d7c72f', 'The Problem People Didn''t Know Existed · Let your cards answer first', 'Your price was the best of the five. You still lost the booking. ⤵
You were just the last to reply.

Picture how a couple actually shops. At 10 p.m. they message five suppliers. By 10:30, two have answered with prices and dates. By morning, they''ve already started talking to one of them. Your reply arrives at 9 a.m. with the best price, and it''s read politely, then left.

Couples don''t compare five quotes side by side the way suppliers imagine. They compare the ones they have when they''re ready, and the conversation that''s already going has a head start.

That''s hard on a small business. You can''t answer at 10 p.m. after a fourteen-hour event, every night of December.

On Setnayan, your shop can have an AI front desk that answers the easy questions (price, dates, inclusions, how far you travel) from your own cards, labelled AI, and hands anything custom to you for the morning.

